  "test_points": [
    {
      "expected": {
        "x": 0.0,
        "y": 0.0
      },
      "inputs": {
        "k": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "expected": {
        "x": 1.5,
        "y": 0.0
      },
      "inputs": {
        "k": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "expected": {
        "x": 3.0,
        "y": 0.0
      },
      "independent_reference": {
        "derived_by": "hooke-linear-superposition",
        "doi": "n/a-hand-derivation",
        "expected": {
          "x": 3.0,
          "y": 0.0
        },
        "source": "Anchor 1. Hooke linear superposition: 7 equal series springs pinned at (0,0) and (10.5000,0), gravity off, share tension equally -> uniform extension, each length GAP/(n-1) = 1.500000 (> rest 1.0, in tension). Particle k sits at x=k*GAP/(n-1)."
      },
      "inputs": {
        "k": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "expected": {
        "x": 4.5,
        "y": 0.0
      },
      "inputs": {
        "k": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "expected": {
        "x": 6.0,
        "y": 0.0
      },
      "independent_reference": {
        "derived_by": "series-spring-equivalent-stiffness",
        "doi": "n/a-hand-derivation",
        "expected": {
          "x": 6.0,
          "y": 0.0
        },
        "source": "Anchor 2. Series-spring equivalent stiffness: n-1 identical springs of stiffness k in series have k_eq = k/(n-1); under end tension T each carries the SAME T, so each extends by the same T/k -> equal lengths. Independent of Anchor 1; agrees on x=6.000000."
      },
      "inputs": {
        "k": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "expected": {
        "x": 7.5,
        "y": 0.0
      },
      "inputs": {
        "k": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "expected": {
        "x": 9.0,
        "y": 0.0
      },
      "independent_reference": {
        "derived_by": "energy-minimisation",
        "doi": "n/a-hand-derivation",
        "expected": {
          "x": 9.0,
          "y": 0.0
        },
        "source": "Anchor 3. Energy minimisation: the elastic energy sum (1/2)k(d_i-rest)^2 at fixed endpoints (sum d_i = GAP) is minimised, by convexity + symmetry, at uniform d_i = GAP/(n-1) (Lagrange multiplier: all d_i equal). Independent of Anchors 1-2; agrees on x=9.000000."
      },
      "inputs": {
        "k": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "expected": {
        "x": 10.5,
        "y": 0.0
      },
      "inputs": {
        "k": 7
      }
    }
